---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <img src="profile100.png" alt="profile picture" />
  <!-- professional -->
  <section class="paragraph">
    <h1><a href="/">porter airlines <span class="red">✦</span></a></h1>
    <p>
      Headquartered in Toronto, Porter Airlines is the third largest aviation
      competitor in Canada. We provide an elevated experience of economy air
      travel through genuine hospitality and sophisticated charm, serving the
      North American network from Eastern Canada.
    </p>
    <p>
      I am proud to work at Porter as one of the primary UX/UI Developers
      involved in feature implementation within the company website. Expanding
      Porter to become a mainstay competitor not just within the east coast, but
      all of North America has been an amazing experience. I have been apart of
      the design, development, maintenance and QA for both new and revitalized
      UI components, ensuring your online booking experience is as smooth as our
      refined flying experience.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="paragraph">
    <h1>neo culture studios <span class="red">✦</span></h1>
    <p>
      Neo Culture Studios is a freelance company started by me and a colleague,
      envisioned with helping family businesses initiate and/or revitalize their
      online presence. Web design, web development and branding were promises
      kept for the clients we acquired.
    </p>
    <p>
      The responsibilities of a small business helped translate immensely to my
      growth in career and character. I learned a lot in various aspects:
      sincere professionalism, understanding the value of time, fulfilling goals
      with satisfaction, and having the courage to blindly jump into the deep
      end.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="paragraph">
    <h1>chaisweets</h1>
    <p>
      Non-profit freelance gig for a relative. Working closely together on this
      local home bakery, I used Figma to design a mock-website that highlighted
      the elegant dessert options and baking methodologies. The goal was to
      expand the brand identity outside of social media and into another digital
      medium.
    </p>
    <p>
      ChaiSweets specializes in beautifully decorated cakes, cupcakes, and
      donuts for special occasions or catering for events. I am proud to have
      supported this professional yet charming business in Calgary.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- personal -->
  <section class="paragraph">
    <h1>portfolio v1 /</h1>
    <p>
      First website iteration to showcase my work, developed in React, Next.js
      and SASS. Based on a minimalism with a subtle touch of animation for
      fluidity. A monochromatic pallete and a hint of my favourite color - red.
    </p>
    <p>
      The main objectives of the site was visual hierarchy, proportion control
      and flow. A lighter or darker tone for each element, margins to promote
      seclusion and draw attention, soft text size and lowercase so the feel
      isn’t too jarring.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most important thing I learned from this project was how to encapsulating
      a theme and focus on sticking with it. There are seemingly infinite
      alternatives or improvements or new features, but we need to focus on what
      we are really trying to capture.
    </p>
    <p>There’s always time to develop another version.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-40);
  }
</style>
